    "desc": "# EVERYTHING YOU SEE HERE IS THE OLD JOHN ROD. IT WILL BE REWORKED IN THE FUTURE.\n\nLore:\n\n**“Don’t make me John Rod you!”**\n\n**A lightning rod Stand that shifts between a flying Rod form and grounded John form. It calls lightning down from the heavens and overwhelms enemies with electric power.**\n\n---\n\n![image.webp](https://trello.com/1/cards/6ab4354f8d818d192cd0e59f/attachments/6ab555078cb43e9147ee816b/previews/6ab555078cb43e9147ee818c/download/image.webp)\n\n## Pose:\n\n![image.webp](https://trello.com/1/cards/6ab4354f8d818d192cd0e59f/attachments/6ab554f6bc6ca9476608fc7a/previews/6ab554f7bc6ca9476608fcc1/download/image.webp)\n\n---\n\n## M1 Light Combo & M2 Attack\n\n![johnrod.gif](https://trello.com/1/cards/6ab4354f8d818d192cd0e59f/attachments/6ab55961f8c58fa92b417555/previews/6ab55969f8c58fa92b418a00/download/johnrod.gif)\n\n## John Form\n\n**Toggle John Rod between its flying Rod form and grounded John form.**\n\n**Base cooldown: 4s**\n\n![jon.gif](https://trello.com/1/cards/6ab4354f8d818d192cd0e59f/attachments/6ab555520a353873e6989672/previews/6ab555620a353873e698aec9/download/jon.gif)\n\n## Blind The Heavens [HOLD / RELEASE]\n\n**Charge and release a briliant cube of light that blinds targets caught inside.**\n\n**Base cooldown: 24s**\n\n![spin.gif](https://trello.com/1/cards/6ab4354f8d818d192cd0e59f/attachments/6ab5562dcc3e9025806047f2/previews/6ab55633cc3e90258060501a/download/spin.gif)\n\n## Lightning Drop\n\n**Hold to rise and launch enemies, then dive through targets and carry them into the impact.**\n\n**Base cooldown: 23s**\n\n![drop2.gif](https://trello.com/1/cards/6ab4354f8d818d192cd0e59f/attachments/6ab557009e90cd2761382f33/previews/6ab557209e90cd27613868d6/download/drop2.gif)\n\n## It’s… So Pretty\n\n**Kick an enemy at close range, finishing them off if their health is low enough. (John Rod Form only)**\n\n**Base cooldown: 35s**\n\n![pretty.gif](https://trello.com/1/cards/6ab4354f8d818d192cd0e59f/attachments/6ab55791e5a88a2d2d6b99c4/previews/6ab55795e5a88a2d2d6b9da9/download/pretty.gif)\n\n## Execution:\n\n![executes.gif](https://trello.com/1/cards/6ab4354f8d818d192cd0e59f/attachments/6ab557d9af1c633dc544c34b/previews/6ab557e4af1c633dc544d093/download/executes.gif)",
